#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.atomic_xchg.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.atomic\\_xchg"
msgstr "cuda.tile.atomic\\_xchg"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_xchg:1 of
msgid "Bulk atomic exchange of array elements at given indices."
msgstr "对指定索引处的数组元素执行批量原子交换（exchange）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_xchg:3 of
msgid ""
"For each specified index, `atomic_xchg()` stores the corresponding "
"`update` to the array element at that location, and returns the original "
"value of the element before the update."
msgstr "对于每个指定索引， ``atomic_xchg()`` 会将对应的 ``update`` 写入该位置的数组元素，并返回更新前该元素的原始值。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_xchg:7 of
msgid ""
"For each individual element, the operation is performed atomically, but "
"the operation as a whole is not atomic, and the order of individual "
"writes is unspecified."
msgstr "对于单个元素而言该操作是原子的，但整体操作并不具备跨元素原子性，且各个元素的写入顺序未指定。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_xchg:10 of
msgid ""
"`atomic_xchg()` follows the same convention as :py:func:`gather()` and "
":py:func:`scatter()`: `indices` must be a tuple whose length equals the "
"`array` rank. All elements of this tuple must be integer tiles or scalars"
" of the same shape, or different shapes that are broadcastable to a "
"common shape. If the array is 1-dimensional, `indices` can be passed as a"
" single tile rather than a tuple of length 1."
msgstr ""
"``atomic_xchg()`` 遵循与 :py:func:`gather()` 和 :py:func:`scatter()` 相同的约定： "
"``indices`` 必须为长度等于 ``array`` "
"秩（rank）的元组。该元组的所有元素都必须是具有相同形状（或可广播到同一公共形状的）整数 Tile 或标量。若数组为一维， "
"``indices`` 可直接作为单个 Tile 传入，而无需包装为长度为 1 的元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_xchg:17 of
msgid ""
"`update` must be a scalar or a tile whose shape is broadcastable to the "
"common shape of `indices`."
msgstr "``update`` 必须为标量或 Tile，其形状需可广播到 ``indices`` 的公共形状。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.atomic_xchg:20 of
msgid ""
"By default, `atomic_xchg()` checks that indices are within the bounds of "
"the array. For indices that are out of bounds, no operation is performed,"
" and an implementation-defined value is returned. To disable bounds "
"checking, set `check_bounds` to ``False``. In this mode, the caller is "
"responsible for ensuring that all indices are within the bounds of the "
"array, and any out-of-bounds access will result in undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下， ``atomic_xchg()`` "
"会检查索引是否在数组边界内。对于越界索引，不会执行任何操作，并返回由实现定义的值。若要禁用边界检查，请将 ``check_bounds`` 设为 "
"``False`` 。在此模式下，调用方须负责确保所有索引均在数组边界内，任何越界访问都将导致未定义行为。"

